			"notes": "## 🆕Features\n\n- Show the name and the description of the items setting in the language of the game, in Chinese and\n  English\n- Draw the items with the icon and the name the game shows for an item\n- Complete an item id per segment, so `stone` completes to `minecraft:stone` just like vanilla, in the\n  screen and in the commands, where a value written without a namespace is the one of the default one"
		},
